//
// Config file for the 5.sim test bench on Verilator (make DUMP=1): trace tb
// and the host's ports (tb.u_rc, the decoder page), not the inside of the
// upstream models or the mock EP, which keeps tb.fst small.

`verilator_config

tracing_off -file "*/vip/hdl/*"
tracing_off -file "*/stubs/*"
